    <section class="faq-page py-120">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-heading text-center">
                <div class="flex-align d-inline-flex gap-8 mb-16">
                    <span class="text-main-600 text-2xl d-flex"><i class="ph-bold ph-book"></i></span>
                    <h5 class="text-main-600 mb-0">FAQs</h5>
                </div>
                <h2 class="mb-24">Find Answers to Your Questions</h2>
                <p class="">Welcome to our FAQs section! Here, we've compiled answers to some of the most common
                    questions our users ask.</p>
            </div>            

            <div class="row gy-4">
                        <div class="col-lg-12">
                            <div class="accordion common-accordion" id="accordionExampleOne">
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                            data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true"
                                            aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                            What is the procedure for enrolling in PDU’s PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            Candidates must choose dates that suit their schedule for attending the PDU PMP prep certification training course. After selecting the dates, they need to complete the application form and finalize their enrollment by submitting the required payment.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                            Who can take PDU’s PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            The PMI-PMP Certification Course is open to IT project managers, project managers, associate project managers, project leaders, project coordinators, project sponsors, project team members, anyone is interesting in becoming a PMP Certified practitioner, and who meets the PMP Certification requirements.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                            How are PDU’s PMP Certification Prep Training courses conducted?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            PDU provides live online instructor-led sessions and self-paced training options for the PMP Prep Certification Training course. These formats give candidates the flexibility to select the learning style that aligns with their preferences and schedules. This approach ensures professionals can effectively prepare for the certification exam in a way that suits their individual needs.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                                            What are the objectives of the PMP Certification Prep Training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            The main goal of the Professional Development Unit’s PMP Certification Prep Course is to equip candidates with the knowledge and skills needed to successfully pass the PMP (Project Management Professional) Certification exam. The course focuses on the following objectives:
                                            </p>
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>Enhance Project Management Skills: The course focuses on improving your project management expertise by applying real-world scenarios and proven principles.</li>
                                                <li>Fulfill Training Requirements: The course delivers the 35 hours of project management education and training necessary to meet the eligibility criteria for the PMP certification.</li>
                                                <li>Self-Paced Learning: The course enables you to study at your own pace, giving you the flexibility to create a schedule that fits your needs.</li>
                                                <li>Practice Exams: The course includes practice exams designed to help you evaluate your knowledge and assess your readiness for the PMP certification exam.</li>
                                                <li>Instructor-Led Training: The course offers instructor-led training options for individuals who prefer a more interactive, face-to-face learning experience.</li>
                                                <li>Agile and Hybrid Approaches: The course includes comprehensive coverage of agile and hybrid project management methodologies, reflecting the latest industry practices.</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                                            Why invest in PDU’s PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            PDU’s PMP Certification Prep Training Course provides a comprehensive platform for candidates to understand project management concepts through engaging, interactive sessions. Our expert trainers facilitate practical exercises to help participants master essential project management skills.
                                            </p>
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            We support candidates with their PMP exam applications and offer proven strategies to excel in the exam. To accommodate working professionals, we provide flexible weekday and weekend class options.
                                            </p>
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            At PDU, the journey to PMP Certification is a partnership. We commit to delivering the most up-to-date information and guidance to help you pass the PMP exam. In return, we encourage you, the candidate, to actively engage with our instruction and go the extra mile to deepen your knowledge and achieve PMP certification success.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">
                                            What are the advantages of attending PDU’s PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            PDU's training course aligns with the international standards set by PMI and is based on the PMBOK 7th Edition. Participants gain valuable skills such as resource allocation, project cost management, and accurate estimation techniques. The program features a four-day interactive classroom experience led by seasoned instructors, providing an engaging and enriching learning environment.
                                            </p>                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">
                                            Does PDU's PMP Certification Prep Training Course fully satisfy the eligibility criteria for the PMI – PMP Certification exam?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            The training program, designed by professional trainers, fulfills the 35 contact hours and other eligibility criteria. It gives candidates a thorough understanding of theoretical concepts and practical applications, preparing them to excel in the exam.
                                            </p>                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEight"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEight">
                                            How does PMI know I participated in a PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseEight" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            Upon completing the PMP Certification Prep training course, candidates receive a course completion certificate. This certificate satisfies the eligibility requirement for PMP certification.
                                            </p>                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseNine"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseNine">
                                            How in depth is the PMP Certification Prep training course?
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseNine" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            The PMP Certification program combines comprehensive learning and exam preparation sessions. It incorporates group discussions, mock tests, case studies, and practical exercises, offering an in-depth and well-rounded approach to mastering the material.
                                            </p>                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                            data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTen"
                                            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTen">
                                            What is the best way to gain a complete understanding of project management if I’m new to the field of project management.
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="collapseTen" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                        data-bs-parent="#accordionExampleOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body">
                                            <p class="accordion-body__desc">
                                            The most effective way to complete the required 35 hours of training is by attending PDU's live online instructor-led PMP Certification Training sessions. These sessions cover all essential topics and skills, catering to newcomers and experienced professionals to ensure comprehensive preparation for the PMP exam.
                                            </p>                                            
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>                        
                    </div>
        </div>
    </section>    
    <div class="certificate">
        <div class="container container--lg">
            <div class="certificate-box px-16 bg-main-600 rounded-16">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="position-relative py-80">
                        <div class="row align-items-center">
                            <div class="col-xl-6">
                                <div class="certificate__content">
                                    <div class="flex-align gap-8 mb-16 wow bounceInDown">
                                        <span class="w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-circle"></span>
                                        <h5 class="text-white mb-0">Get Certificate</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <h2 class="text-white mb-40 fw-medium wow bounceIn">Build Expertise with Professional Development Programs.
                                    </h2>
                                    <a href="https://pdu-edu.org/contact"
                                        class="btn btn-white rounded-pill flex-align d-inline-flex gap-8 hover-bg-main-800 wow bounceInUp">
                                        Get Started Now
                                        <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-up-right d-flex text-lg"></i>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6 d-xl-block d-none">
                                <div class="certificate__thumb" data-aos="fade-up-left">
                                    <img src="assets/images/thumbs/certificate-img.png" alt="certificate image" data-tilt
                                        data-tilt-max="8" data-tilt-speed="500" data-tilt-perspective="5000"
                                        data-tilt-full-page-listening>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>  
